	partition Date = calculated
		mode: import
		source = ```
				ADDCOLUMNS (
				    CALENDAR ( DATE ( 2025, 9, 1 ), MAX ( Activity[event_date] ) ),
				    "Year", YEAR ( [Date] ),
				    "MonthNo", MONTH ( [Date] ),
				    "Month", FORMAT ( [Date], "mmm" ),
				    "Year Month", FORMAT ( [Date], "yyyy-mm" ),
				    "MonthStart", DATE ( YEAR ( [Date] ), MONTH ( [Date] ), 1 )
				)
				```

